  friction  0.68, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.0001
  bounce    dead
  colour    wood

ramp2 lip left
  is a  point
  at    2.051 m along, 0.15 m to the left, 1.055 m up

ramp2 lip right
  is a  point
  at    2.051 m along, -0.15 m to the left, 1.055 m up

ramp2 release lip
